WEBVTT

00:17.957 --> 00:23.017
<b>To think such delicate children 
would be able to reach me.</b>

00:23.017 --> 00:27.297
<b>It seems fate dearly loves toying with me.</b>

00:28.137 --> 00:32.597
<b>Therefore, you two must die here.</b>

00:34.267 --> 00:36.247
<b>Once I destroy everything</b>

00:36.247 --> 00:38.227
<b>and offer up this world,</b>

00:38.227 --> 00:40.197
<b>I will obtain my freedom.</b>

00:40.197 --> 00:43.007
<b>That was the agreement I forged with God.</b>

00:46.327 --> 00:49.487
<b>I'd like to confirm one 
thing before we do battle.</b>

00:50.057 --> 00:54.207
<b>Do you two believe in the existence of God?</b>

00:55.707 --> 00:59.037
<b>No such thing exists.</b>

02:32.507 --> 02:34.007
Then the Game of the Gods Begins

02:38.297 --> 02:43.187
<b>I know not how you managed 
to destroy my minions,</b>

02:39.477 --> 02:43.187
The Demon Lord has appeared!

02:46.187 --> 02:48.147
The Demon Lord has deployed Dark Barrier!

02:47.267 --> 02:50.197
<b>but you will not even scratch me.</b>

02:57.787 --> 03:00.247
The power of the Hero has dispelled the darkness!

02:57.787 --> 03:00.247
Dark Barrier has vanished!

03:00.567 --> 03:04.827
<b>My Dark Barrier prevents all 
physical and magic attacks.</b>

03:04.827 --> 03:07.457
<b>Only the Hero can negate it!</b>

03:08.007 --> 03:09.417
<b>What's going on here?</b>

03:09.877 --> 03:14.047
<b>I was promised that a Hero 
didn't exist in this world.</b>

03:20.847 --> 03:23.647
<b>You have no intention of conversing, do you?</b>

03:24.557 --> 03:25.977
<b>Come to think of it,</b>

03:25.977 --> 03:29.237
<b>the Hero I knew was also a silent man.</b>

03:39.827 --> 03:42.037
The Demon Lord transformed into his true form!

03:42.037 --> 03:45.637
<b>Is it that odd for me to 
transform from the start?</b>

03:45.637 --> 03:48.787
<b>Many of my limitations have 
been lost in this world,</b>

03:48.787 --> 03:52.927
<b>so fighting you in stages like I 
did in the game would be uncouth.</b>

03:52.927 --> 03:54.897
<b>Defeating the two of you</b>

03:54.897 --> 03:57.197
<b>must be a trial imposed upon me.</b>

03:57.197 --> 04:01.397
<b>My intuition tells me I must 
not underestimate you.</b>

04:01.397 --> 04:05.697
<b>Now, blades, bring me their deaths!</b>

04:09.957 --> 04:11.187
<b>So pretty!</b>

04:14.567 --> 04:17.027
The Demon Lord's weapons have forgotten how to attack.

04:17.367 --> 04:18.327
<b>Caria!</b>

04:18.327 --> 04:19.247
<b>Yes!</b>

04:21.947 --> 04:24.787
The ground has been infected with Plague and melted
 away from rot.

04:24.787 --> 04:26.247
<b>Impudent!</b>

04:36.927 --> 04:38.347
The Demon Lord's weapons have 
forgotten their curses.

04:38.657 --> 04:40.507
<b>What absurdity!</b>

04:40.507 --> 04:43.097
<b>But that is what makes it a trial for me!</b>

05:04.147 --> 05:05.647
<b>I won't be defeated!</b>

05:05.647 --> 05:08.047
<b>God is on my side.</b>

05:08.577 --> 05:10.977
<b>I will fulfill my agreement with God</b>

05:10.977 --> 05:13.837
<b>and obtain my peace and freedom.</b>

05:17.097 --> 05:19.087
<b>There is no God, you know?</b>

05:19.087 --> 05:20.387
<b>They don't exist anywhere.</b>

05:20.787 --> 05:23.727
<b>If you believe that something 
will come to save you,</b>

05:23.727 --> 05:25.847
<b>then you'll only face awful suffering later.</b>

05:25.847 --> 05:28.167
<b>We never should have believed that.</b>

05:28.167 --> 05:30.857
<b>We lost everything because 
we dared to believe that.</b>

05:33.167 --> 05:35.127
<b>I will not die!</b>

05:35.127 --> 05:37.377
<b>So long as my will remains,</b>

05:37.377 --> 05:39.767
<b>then I swear upon the name of God,</b>

05:39.767 --> 05:41.757
<b>I will not die!</b>

05:40.817 --> 05:42.787
The Demon Lord healed his injuries through
 sheer willpower!

05:44.837 --> 05:46.137
<b>Oh!</b>

05:46.137 --> 05:50.007
<b>I knew God was watching over me!</b>

05:50.007 --> 05:51.667
<b>Now, listen!</b>

05:51.667 --> 05:56.717
<b>The name of the God that 
will grant me victory is...</b>

05:58.627 --> 06:01.597
One must not invoke

05:58.627 --> 06:01.597
the name of God in vain.

06:11.007 --> 06:12.327
<b>Who are you?</b>

06:13.287 --> 06:15.817
<b>Huh? Did I just screw up?</b>

06:16.717 --> 06:18.687
<b>Why have you interfered?</b>

06:18.687 --> 06:20.057
<b>Well, uh...</b>

06:20.057 --> 06:21.827
<b>you two were under attack,</b>

06:21.827 --> 06:23.527
<b>so I thought I'd save you?</b>

06:23.837 --> 06:26.247
<b>Did we look like we needed saving?</b>

06:26.557 --> 06:29.607
<b>Well, what do I say? It was an accident?</b>

06:29.607 --> 06:31.577
<b>Yeah, it was an accident! Believe me!</b>

06:31.967 --> 06:37.917
<b>Come on, those angry looks don't 
belong on cute girls like you, right?</b>

06:38.367 --> 06:40.797
<b>Did you interfere to achieve some objective?</b>

06:41.287 --> 06:42.137
<b>Stop it!</b>

06:42.517 --> 06:44.347
<b>With the power you two have now,</b>

06:45.047 --> 06:46.597
<b>you'll never beat me.</b>

06:47.267 --> 06:49.427
<b>This boy is weird.</b>

06:49.427 --> 06:51.457
<b>Everything he says sounds like a lie.</b>

06:51.457 --> 06:53.687
<b>But that doesn't even matter.</b>

06:53.687 --> 06:56.607
<b>This boy defiled our battle.</b>

06:57.017 --> 07:00.447
<b>He ruined our atonement to Mother.</b>

07:03.787 --> 07:04.907
<b>That's enough.</b>

07:09.957 --> 07:12.007
<b><i>Glacial Decapitation...</i></b>

07:12.007 --> 07:14.087
<b><i>Being guaranteed to hit is simply the result.</i></b>

07:14.087 --> 07:16.797
<b><i>Its true essence is halting all phenomena?</i></b>

07:17.537 --> 07:20.877
<b><i>I'm surprised it can force its way 
into actions already initiated.</i></b>

07:20.877 --> 07:22.757
<b>Urk, another girl?</b>

07:25.287 --> 07:27.657
<b>Our king has issued orders to return.</b>

07:27.657 --> 07:30.007
<b>You've accomplished your 
goal, haven't you? Then—</b>

07:30.007 --> 07:31.687
<b>That boy interfered!</b>

07:39.887 --> 07:42.487
<b>I don't think you understood me.</b>

07:42.977 --> 07:46.277
<b>I just conveyed our king's orders.</b>

07:46.277 --> 07:48.907
<b>We don't want you to get in our way.</b>

07:49.447 --> 07:52.007
<b>You little brat!</b>

07:52.007 --> 07:54.327
<b>Have you grown arrogant with power?!</b>

07:56.137 --> 07:58.657
<b><i>I can't take the twins' powers lightly.</i></b>

07:58.657 --> 08:00.457
<b><i>Though that's not a problem.</i></b>

08:00.987 --> 08:04.337
<b><i>Using that technique prevents 
me from moving for a while,</i></b>

08:04.587 --> 08:07.677
<b><i>but I already confirmed I can move again first.</i></b>

08:08.257 --> 08:10.057
<b><i>So long as I don't kill them,</i></b>

08:10.057 --> 08:12.097
<b><i>King Takuto will forgive me.</i></b>

08:16.057 --> 08:19.237
<b>We won't let you interfere either, Atou.</b>

08:19.237 --> 08:22.257
<b>After all, our king already told us</b>

08:22.257 --> 08:24.027
<b>we can do anything.</b>

08:24.727 --> 08:26.857
<b>You're free to do anything,</b>

08:26.857 --> 08:30.327
<b>and you don't have to ask 
for forgiveness to do anything.</b>

08:35.207 --> 08:38.497
<b>So long as you behave in a way 
your mother would be proud of,</b>

08:38.497 --> 08:41.337
<b>then I'll praise everything about you.</b>

08:43.087 --> 08:45.197
<b>My, my!</b>

08:45.197 --> 08:47.717
<b>What adorable little girls you are!</b>

08:47.997 --> 08:51.177
<b>So long as our mother would be proud...</b>

08:51.747 --> 08:53.777
<b>So rest easy.</b>

08:53.777 --> 08:58.227
<b>Now, come sleep in your Isla's arms.</b>

08:59.227 --> 09:01.937
<b>What would our mother think?</b>

09:17.367 --> 09:19.707
<b>Caria, let's stop now.</b>

09:20.137 --> 09:21.797
<b>Big Sis...</b>

09:26.027 --> 09:28.337
<b>Atou, we're sorry.</b>

09:28.337 --> 09:31.347
<b>I'm sorry for saying such rude things.</b>

09:32.677 --> 09:34.727
<b>Given the current situation,</b>

09:34.727 --> 09:38.207
<b>I'll pretend your outburst never 
happened if you'll follow your orders.</b>

09:38.207 --> 09:41.357
<b>Sorry for butting in! Later!</b>

09:44.807 --> 09:46.807
<b>A student's uniform?</b>

09:46.807 --> 09:50.257
<b>If he's the kind of entity 
King Takuto predicted,</b>

09:50.257 --> 09:52.477
<b>then we just have to ignore him for now.</b>

09:52.477 --> 09:53.907
<b>Atou?</b>

09:54.327 --> 09:56.177
<b>Is it possible to bring Mama Isla...</b>

09:56.177 --> 09:57.867
<b>back to life?</b>

10:01.137 --> 10:04.387
<b>Unfortunately, Isla is dead.</b>

10:26.007 --> 10:27.917
<b><i>Yeah, got it.</i></b>

10:27.917 --> 10:29.877
<b><i>Everything should be fine now,</i></b>

10:29.877 --> 10:31.107
<b><i>but be careful on your way home.</i></b>

10:31.777 --> 10:34.597
<b><i>Understood. I'll see you later.</i></b>

10:36.537 --> 10:38.077
<b><i>It's over.</i></b>

10:38.427 --> 10:42.647
<b><i>The mechanics of a 4X strategy 
game were applied to this world.</i></b>

10:42.647 --> 10:45.297
<b><i>I thought that was a cheat exclusive to me.</i></b>

10:45.987 --> 10:51.007
<b><i>But now we've faced an enemy with a 
different cheat—the use of RPG mechanics.</i></b>

10:49.007 --> 10:51.007
The Demon Lord transformed into his true form!

10:51.877 --> 10:55.427
<b>There are plenty of other 
genres of games out there too.</b>

11:00.017 --> 11:02.897
<b>Th-That was scary!</b>

11:03.357 --> 11:06.647
<b>What did they mean, "There are 
pretty, innocent girls in danger.</b>

11:06.647 --> 11:09.787
<b>I want you to go to rescue them right away."</b>

11:09.787 --> 11:11.197
<b>Stupid God!</b>

11:11.197 --> 11:13.317
<b>Master!</b>

11:14.047 --> 11:16.007
<b>Oh...</b>

11:16.007 --> 11:19.197
<b>Yes! It's your slave girl...</b>

11:19.607 --> 11:21.107
<b>You weren't hurt, right?</b>

11:21.107 --> 11:22.587
<b>I'm all right!</b>

11:22.587 --> 11:26.647
<b>God's mysterious power is 
protecting me, after all!</b>

11:26.647 --> 11:30.337
<b>So, umm, I received a message for you.</b>

11:30.767 --> 11:33.987
<b>"Sorry!" they said.</b>

11:34.967 --> 11:36.887
<b>They're making a fool out of me!</b>

11:36.887 --> 11:41.687
<b>For starters, that crazy god 
transferred me here on a wim!</b>

11:44.337 --> 11:46.727
<b>Well, that meant I got to meet you.</b>

11:48.227 --> 11:50.107
<b>Master!</b>

11:53.007 --> 11:55.827
<b>And they did give me OP powers,</b>

11:55.827 --> 11:57.577
<b>so I am grateful.</b>

11:57.577 --> 12:00.537
<b>Y-You're incredible, Master!</b>

12:00.907 --> 12:02.287
<b>Good grief.</b>

12:02.287 --> 12:05.247
<b>I guess things don't go as conveniently 
as they do in anime and novels.</b>

12:05.707 --> 12:09.017
<b>Well, still, I guess I'll go save the world!</b>

12:09.017 --> 12:12.837
<b>Yes! My exclusive Master!</b>

12:16.717 --> 12:18.007
<b>Hey, hey!</b>

12:18.007 --> 12:19.677
<b>Nice to meet you, and long time no see!</b>

12:19.677 --> 12:22.387
<b>You doing well, Sainty?</b>

12:22.697 --> 12:26.347
<b>I'm finally going to 
uncover your secret today.</b>

12:26.347 --> 12:29.817
<b>Man, this is battle number nineteen, huh?</b>

12:29.817 --> 12:33.777
<b><i>I've made sure to bury 
her all eighteen times before.</i></b>

12:34.537 --> 12:36.987
<b><i>Even when I completely 
incinerated her corpse,</i></b>

12:36.987 --> 12:39.167
<b><i>and even when I cast seals on it,</i></b>

12:39.167 --> 12:41.117
<b><i>she came back to life like nothing happened.</i></b>

12:41.587 --> 12:44.557
<b><i>This calamity won't end 
until I unravel her mystery.</i></b>

12:44.557 --> 12:45.867
<b>You're so stiff!</b>

12:45.867 --> 12:47.577
<b>Why not be a little more chill?</b>

12:47.997 --> 12:52.117
<b>I'm simply here to eliminate 
evil in the name of God.</b>

12:52.117 --> 12:56.397
<b>Well, to be blunt, I'm going to 
get angry if I don't win soon.</b>

12:56.397 --> 12:57.547
<b>So...</b>

12:57.927 --> 13:00.507
<b>Time to roll the dice again today.</b>

13:14.997 --> 13:16.777
<b>Uhh...</b>

13:17.737 --> 13:19.947
<b>Did I just crit?</b>

13:20.077 --> 13:21.877
<b>Hell yeah!</b>

13:21.877 --> 13:23.617
<b>Rolled a crit!</b>

13:24.007 --> 13:25.597
<b>This nineteenth iteration did it!</b>

13:25.597 --> 13:28.217
<b>After tweaking and
tweaking my sheet,</b>

13:28.217 --> 13:31.627
<b>Erakino has finally become 
the strongest character!</b>

13:31.627 --> 13:33.797
<b>Master! Are you watching?!</b>

13:33.797 --> 13:35.297
<b>I did it!</b>

13:35.297 --> 13:36.757
<b>Praise me! Praise me!</b>

13:37.057 --> 13:37.767
<b>Oh?</b>

13:37.767 --> 13:41.507
<b>Sure! It's a request from God, after all!</b>

13:41.507 --> 13:43.177
<b>Aye, sir! Aye, sir!</b>

13:43.177 --> 13:45.227
<b>My Game Master!</b>

13:46.977 --> 13:49.057
<b>Mynoghra, huh?</b>

13:49.057 --> 13:52.517
<b>Now, Erakino, time to get to work!</b>

13:53.157 --> 13:55.897
<b>As the Dice God wills!</b>

13:55.897 --> 13:58.987
<b>As the roll of the dice demands!</b>

14:02.217 --> 14:07.847
<b><i>Going forward, I might have to fight 
other enemies with other game mechanics.</i></b>

14:07.847 --> 14:09.667
<b><i>If we repeat our performance here this time,</i></b>

14:10.007 --> 14:12.717
<b><i>then we'll be wiped out next time.</i></b>

14:14.427 --> 14:15.367
<b>My king!</b>

14:15.367 --> 14:17.467
<b>Please forgive me for coming to you directly,</b>

14:17.467 --> 14:20.047
<b>but the telepathy wasn't reaching you!</b>

14:20.337 --> 14:23.547
<b>We've restored the guard around 
the Palace, so please return!</b>

14:23.547 --> 14:24.637
<b>Leave me alone.</b>

14:25.007 --> 14:26.987
<b>F-Forgive me!</b>

14:29.417 --> 14:31.097
<b>I'm being lousy.</b>

14:31.687 --> 14:34.447
<b>Because I got arrogant, I lost Isla</b>

14:34.447 --> 14:37.067
<b>and wound up betraying the twins' trust.</b>

14:37.367 --> 14:40.567
<b>My naivety caused all of this.</b>

14:42.117 --> 14:43.277
<b>Dammit!</b>

14:48.247 --> 14:49.007
<b>Huh?</b>

14:52.847 --> 14:54.877
<b>No way, right?</b>

15:09.717 --> 15:12.407
<b>This isn't a game I'm 
controlling from the outside.</b>

15:12.407 --> 15:15.857
<b>Since I'm part of this world, that 
means I'm a unit too, doesn't it?</b>

15:16.337 --> 15:18.317
<b>How did I never notice that before?</b>

15:18.687 --> 15:21.317
<b>Why didn't I test that from the start?!</b>

15:21.317 --> 15:24.537
<b>If I had known that, she 
wouldn't have had to die!</b>

15:30.997 --> 15:33.077
<b>We're holding an emergency meeting.</b>

15:33.467 --> 15:38.667
<b>First, I'd like to request the sentence 
for the Elfuur Sisters' insubordination.</b>

15:39.257 --> 15:40.507
<b>Nothing.</b>

15:41.007 --> 15:42.717
<b>They won't be charged with a crime.</b>

15:42.717 --> 15:44.047
<b>King Takuto!</b>

15:44.047 --> 15:46.927
<b>We wouldn't be upholding this country's laws!</b>

15:46.927 --> 15:49.637
<b>Especially in emergencies like this one,</b>

15:49.637 --> 15:51.527
<b>we can't permit exceptions without reason—</b>

15:51.527 --> 15:53.807
<b>Emergencies, huh?</b>

15:54.177 --> 15:58.227
<b>I need to apologize to 
you all regarding that.</b>

16:01.287 --> 16:03.217
<b>I'm truly sorry.</b>

16:03.217 --> 16:05.907
<b>This was brought about by my 
arrogance and carelessness.</b>

16:05.907 --> 16:08.227
<b>P-Please stop!</b>

16:08.227 --> 16:10.577
<b>A king must never apologize!</b>

16:10.577 --> 16:13.037
<b>It's all because we weren't good enough!</b>

16:13.787 --> 16:15.827
<b>I also promise you this.</b>

16:15.827 --> 16:17.497
<b>I will bring Isla back to life.</b>

16:19.757 --> 16:21.547
<b>Y-You mean it?</b>

16:21.967 --> 16:23.467
<b>You can bring her back to life?</b>

16:23.467 --> 16:25.037
<b>Please hold on!</b>

16:25.037 --> 16:26.217
<b>I beg your pardon,</b>

16:26.217 --> 16:29.367
<b>but in our current situation, resurrecting 
our Heroes isn't an option!</b>

16:29.367 --> 16:31.857
<b>"Their people shall be 
welcomed into the heavens,</b>

16:31.857 --> 16:36.477
<b>and they shall live for eternity in endless 
harmony at the pinnacle of happiness.</b>

16:36.477 --> 16:39.177
<b>There shall be no pain or suffering there,</b>

16:39.177 --> 16:43.107
<b>and the dead shall return to life to 
rejoin their loved ones once more."</b>

16:43.997 --> 16:47.647
<b>The Ascension Victory—the victory in which 
a civilization ascends to a higher plane.</b>

16:47.647 --> 16:51.407
<b>If this world is drawing on the 
mechanics of <i>Eternal Nations</i>,</b>

16:51.407 --> 16:54.647
<b>then I vow to seize that victory.</b>

16:54.647 --> 16:56.787
<b>To restore all we've lost.</b>

16:57.197 --> 16:59.747
<b>B-But the victory conditions 
are far too difficult!</b>

16:59.747 --> 17:03.217
<b>The Ascension Victory essentially 
means recreating the world itself!</b>

17:03.217 --> 17:05.207
<b>The moment others learn 
we're aiming for that,</b>

17:05.207 --> 17:06.837
<b>the entire world will turn against us!</b>

17:07.177 --> 17:08.437
<b>That's all right!</b>

17:08.437 --> 17:10.847
<b>What grounds do you have 
for concluding that?!</b>

17:11.367 --> 17:15.327
<b>Because we'll just kill 
everyone who gets in our way.</b>

17:18.487 --> 17:20.687
<b>Emergency Production?</b>

17:20.687 --> 17:23.947
<b>Now, let's go conquer the world!</b>

17:25.177 --> 17:28.067
<b>To be honest, I think this will 
be challenging for all of you!</b>

17:28.067 --> 17:30.527
<b>But I know that together, we can do this!</b>

17:30.917 --> 17:34.407
<b>Just be sure to listen to what 
I tell you from now on, okay?</b>

17:40.057 --> 17:42.247
<b><i>Modern weapons won't be 
good enough on their own.</i></b>

17:42.667 --> 17:44.827
<b><i>If we want to achieve the Ascension Victory,</i></b>

17:44.827 --> 17:47.717
<b><i>I'll need to devise an intricate strategy.</i></b>

17:48.147 --> 17:52.087
<b><i>I'll have to manage every detail 
of my units' actions myself.</i></b>

17:53.357 --> 17:56.617
<b>I should check on the state 
of our civilization once more.</b>

17:58.487 --> 18:01.497
<b>The Dark Elves are all gathered in one spot?</b>

18:03.517 --> 18:05.147
<b>What's that?</b>

18:11.567 --> 18:17.037
<b>We'll have Lady Isla watch over the 
future of our nation from here.</b>

18:17.547 --> 18:20.497
<b>Hero of Mynoghra, may you rest in peace.</b>

18:20.797 --> 18:22.437
<b>It's not a grave.</b>

18:22.437 --> 18:26.877
<b>Mama Isla's just going to be 
resting there for a while.</b>

18:27.207 --> 18:29.127
<b>Our king told us</b>

18:29.127 --> 18:31.617
<b>that he would bring Mother back to life.</b>

18:31.617 --> 18:35.097
<b>So I'm sure Mother will come back to life!</b>

18:37.317 --> 18:41.517
<b>Do you think we can achieve the 
results our king seeks from us?</b>

18:41.867 --> 18:43.557
<b>He was terrifying.</b>

18:43.557 --> 18:48.187
<b>Today, our king was far more terrifying 
than he was when I first spoke to him.</b>

18:48.187 --> 18:51.407
<b>I'm not sure we can keep 
up with our king's plans...</b>

18:55.367 --> 18:58.147
<b>You're all being big children.</b>

18:58.147 --> 19:00.667
<b>Only children get frightened, 
lose confidence,</b>

19:00.667 --> 19:04.377
<b>and become incapable of doing 
what they should be doing.</b>

19:04.377 --> 19:06.627
<b>Should I be giving you head pats?</b>

19:10.087 --> 19:12.547
<b>To think we're being chastised by children!</b>

19:13.937 --> 19:15.257
<b>But they're right.</b>

19:15.257 --> 19:17.847
<b>Growing timid like this is childish.</b>

19:18.117 --> 19:20.177
<b>Even our young ones</b>

19:20.177 --> 19:22.067
<b>don't hesitate to serve our king.</b>

19:22.837 --> 19:26.687
<b>I once again vow to follow our king to the 
end, no matter how terrifying it may be,</b>

19:26.687 --> 19:29.277
<b>and even if the whole world turns against us.</b>

19:29.657 --> 19:33.887
<b>Our king has always put his trust 
in us and made good use of us.</b>

19:33.887 --> 19:36.237
<b>Now it's our turn to trust our king.</b>

19:36.237 --> 19:38.807
<b>Even if it's lacking, I'll 
scrounge up what wisdom I can</b>

19:38.807 --> 19:41.177
<b>and devise strategies to offer to our king!</b>

19:41.177 --> 19:42.227
<b>Let's go!</b>

19:42.227 --> 19:43.207
<b>Yes!</b>

20:12.467 --> 20:15.947
<b>I came close to choosing 
the most horrible strategy.</b>

20:16.577 --> 20:19.227
<b>It was thanks to everyone here with me,</b>

20:20.137 --> 20:23.117
<b>That we became this nation, 
distinct from the game.</b>

20:24.317 --> 20:27.407
<b>That we became Mynoghra. Our nation.</b>

20:43.057 --> 20:47.687
<b><i>I shut myself away after I was unable to 
find the words to say to King Takuto yesterday...</i></b>

20:48.737 --> 20:50.727
<b><i>But today, it's different.</i></b>

20:51.247 --> 20:53.927
<b><i>No matter how King Takuto may change,</i></b>

20:53.927 --> 20:56.317
<b><i>my loyalty to him never will!</i></b>

20:56.947 --> 20:59.657
<b>My great and mighty king, King Ira Takuto!</b>

20:59.657 --> 21:02.117
<b>Your Sludge Atou is here!</b>

21:02.727 --> 21:04.117
<b>There, there.</b>

21:04.117 --> 21:06.827
<b>We want you to cheer up, my king.</b>

21:09.527 --> 21:13.127
<b>K-King Takuto?!</b>

21:14.257 --> 21:18.337
<b>I got so carried away yesterday 
that I frightened everyone...</b>

21:18.337 --> 21:21.217
<b>I-It's all right! It's all right!</b>

21:21.567 --> 21:24.307
<b>I shouldn't have said it the way I did...</b>

21:24.307 --> 21:27.597
<b>Th-Then if you were to rephrase it now?</b>

21:27.597 --> 21:28.937
<b>If you were?</b>

21:31.867 --> 21:35.857
<b>I won't let the people who place 
their trust in me suffer again.</b>

21:36.337 --> 21:38.487
<b>So let's all work together</b>

21:39.287 --> 21:41.987
<b>to achieve the Ascension Victory!</b>

21:43.027 --> 21:44.697
<b>I'll follow you wherever you may go.</b>

21:45.057 --> 21:46.157
<b>We'll help!</b>

21:46.547 --> 21:48.367
<b>You can do it, my king!</b>

21:49.447 --> 21:50.837
<b>It's something only I can do.</b>

21:51.497 --> 21:54.497
<b>As the top player of <i>Eternal Nations</i>,</b>

21:56.007 --> 21:59.017
<b>I'll bring us victory out 
of these circumstances.</b>

22:15.647 --> 22:18.317
<b>John Pickett 
Henry Lin 
Meagan Smith 
William Haggard 
Rei Miyasaka</b>

22:15.647 --> 22:18.317
